(a) (1) Outdoor watering for purposes of planting, growing, managing, or maintaining ground cover, trees, shrubs, or other plants may occur only between the hours of 4:00 p.m. and 10:00 a.m. (12:00 midnight to 10:00 a.m. and 4:00 p.m. to 12:00 midnight).
(2) Paragraph (1) of this section shall not create any limitation upon the following outdoor water uses:
